Kept so the directory survives in git after the unreferenced Next.js starter
assets (next/vercel/window/globe/file.svg) were deleted. The Dockerfile does
`COPY --from=builder /app/public ./public`, which fails outright if public/
does not exist. The favicon lives at src/app/icon.svg (App Router convention)
and the mark is an inline component, so nothing else needs to be here.
